* GnuCap LED Smoke Test - Single LED, 3.3V supply
* Matches test.spice: V1 -> R1(470) -> D1(MyLED) -> GND
V1 1 0 DC 3.3
R1 1 2 470
D1 2 0 MyLED

.model MyLED D Is=1e-14 Rs=10

* DC sweep matching test.spice range: 0 to 3.3V in 0.1V steps
.dc V1 0 3.3 0.1

* Print LED anode voltage and diode current
* Safe operating check: i(D1) should stay well below 20mA
.print dc v(2) i(D1)

.end